  "title": "iSCSI: Fix LBAs and display Binary Prefix sizes",
  "description": "LBAs are zero-based thus one(1) must be added to them.\n\nThe existing Read Capacity sizes in dissect_sbc_readcapacity10()\nare displayed in SI rather than Binary Prefix format. Since the\nbyte capacity sizes are calculated in 1024-byte chunks, they must\nbe displayed as Binary Prefixes. These abbreviations are now\ndisplayed in the Packet Detail and List panes.",
  "state": "merged",
