      ],
      "title": "LBAs are zero-based thus one(1) must be added to them.",
      "message": "LBAs are zero-based thus one(1) must be added to them.\n\nThe existing Read Capicty sizes in dissect_sbc_readcapacity10()\nare displayed in SI rather than Binary Prefixe format. Since the\nbyte capacity sizes are calculated in 1024-byte chunks, they must\nbe displayed as Binary Prefixes. These abbreviations are now\ndisplayed in the Packet Detail and List panes.\n",
      "author_name": "Cal Turney",
      "author_email": "cturney111@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2023-11-13T17:55:16.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2023-11-23T05:55:43.000+00:00",
