      ],
      "title": "iSCSI Read Capacity",
      "message": "iSCSI Read Capacity\n\n1. Updated packet-scsi-sbc.c to try and make Ubuntu happy.\n2. packet-tcp.c (from another MR) was accidentally included in this\n   MR. The unchanged packet-tcp.c from master has been included in\n   this commit.\n",
      "author_name": "Cal Turney",
      "author_email": "cturney111@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2023-11-11T17:34:55.000-05:00",
